	(gr_text "FABRICATION NOTES - led_driver\n1. 60 x 45 mm, 4 layers, FR-4 TG155 or better, 1.6 mm finished.\n2. Stack-up JLCPCB JLC04161H-1080: F.Cu 1 oz | 1080 prepreg 0.0764 | In1.Cu 0.5 oz GND\n   | core 1.265 | In2.Cu 0.5 oz GND | 1080 prepreg 0.0764 | B.Cu 1 oz.\n3. Surface finish ENIG. Green solder mask, white silkscreen.\n4. Tracks: Default 0.25 mm, Power 0.4 mm; minimum clearance 0.15 mm. Vias 0.3 mm drill / 0.6 mm pad.\n5. Vias in exposed pads (thermal vias): epoxy filled and capped if offered, otherwise tented.\n6. Impedance not controlled. Electrical test 100 %.\n7. Assembly: all parts on the top side; BOM and CPL in fab/ (LCSC part numbers)."
		(at 100 149 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "4f1a97b0-7400-43c7-aa91-0b13acaf85ed")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
